{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:7df077580570cb24","name":"Master of Intrigue Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-7df077580570cb24","title":"Master of Intrigue Talent Tree","revision":21210,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T01:21:50Z","sha256":"ed0994a77c7c67af3e71fad781eba720db03718c2de2b69d07391f820002fa7d","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21210","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Master%20of%20Intrigue%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-7df077580570cb24","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy of Intrigue"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_of_Intrigue"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You are a skilled manipulator and have mastered the art of working behind the scenes to accomplish your goals. Flash and spectacle are inferior tools, only suitable for those without your unique talents.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Advanced Planning"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["When you roll ",{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"}," for combat, choose one willing ally within your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"},". You and that ally swap ",{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"}," results.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["This section was titled Blend In in its official source, but has been renamed to distinguish it from the similarly named \"",{"tag":"a","children":["Blend In"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Blend_In"},".\""]}]},"\n"]}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Blending In"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["You know how to blend into a variety of cultures and groups with ease. As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},", you gain ",{"tag":"a","children":["Total Concealment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Total_Concealment"}," when adjacent to at least two other creatures. This benefit does not apply to attacks from adjacent creatures.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Done It All"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["When you select this Talent, choose two ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talents"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talents","referenceId":"reference:e8871b70ebfa07d9"}," (from any non-",{"tag":"a","children":["Prestige Class"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Prestige_Class"},") that you do not possess but for which you meet the prerequisites. Once per turn on your turn, you can spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Free Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Free_Action"}," to gain the benefits of one of those ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talents"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talents","referenceId":"reference:e8871b70ebfa07d9"}," until the end of your next turn.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Get Into Position"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Once per encounter, at the start of your first turn, choose two allies within 12 squares and in your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"},". Each ally can immediately ",{"tag":"a","children":["Move"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Move","referenceId":"reference:6ecc3df6bffdd06c"}," up to their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reaction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reaction"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["This section was titled Master Manipulator in its official source, but has been renamed to distinguish it from the similarly named \"",{"tag":"a","children":["Master Manipulator"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Master_Manipulator"},".\""]}]},"\n"]}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Master Manipulations"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Advanced Planning"]},", ",{"tag":"b","children":["Get Into Position"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You are a master of making things happen the way you want them to. You can use each of the following actions once per encounter as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"}," on your turn:\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Demand Recovery:"]}," Select one ally within 5 squares and in your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"},". That ally moves +5 steps on the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"}," and gains a +2 morale bonus to attack rolls and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Checks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Checks"}," until the end of your next turn."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Exceptional Control:"]}," Roll a d20 and note the result. Once before the end of the encounter, as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reaction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reaction"}," you can replace the result of an enemy's or ally's d20 roll with the result you rolled for this ability. The enemy or ally must be within your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"},"."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Word of Warning:"]}," Select one ally within 5 squares and in your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"},". Once before the end of the encounter, as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reaction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reaction"}," to that ally having any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Defense Score"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Defense_Score"}," targeted by a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Check"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Check"}," or an attack, you can replace that ally's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Defense Score"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Defense_Score"}," with your same ",{"tag":"a","children":["Defense Score"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Defense_Score"}," until the attack or the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Check"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Check"}," is resolved."]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Retaliation"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Advanced Planning"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Whenever you move down the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"}," as a result of taking damage that equals or exceeds your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Threshold"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Threshold"},", the next time you hit and damage a creature or a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," with a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Melee Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Melee_Attack"}," or a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attack"}," before the end of your next turn, you automatically move the target -1 step on the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
